		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Re: V4.1 hardware no NOAA receive]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2155&amp;p=17851#p17851"><![CDATA[
On my V4 radio the problem was actually nothing to do with the frequencies. The radio did not receive on VHF on any frequency at initial power on. <br><br>This seems to be a problem with the VHF Receive synthesiser. It needs to be programmed immediately after the power is applied or it locks up and cannot be programmed until the power is cycled by going to Tx and back to Rx. <br><br>The firmware has a short delay after powering on the radio while things are initialised and this was causing the problem. <br><br>I have submitted a fix which should be included in the next firmware release. <br><br>Colin G4EML<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Wed Mar 16, 2022 1:24 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
